WEBVTT

00:10:25.788 --> 00:10:30.793
It's clear that liberal
institutions, rule of law,

00:10:30.834 --> 00:10:33.003
functioning courts,
private-property rights

00:10:33.045 --> 00:10:37.299
have been very powerful
in this project of fostering innovation.

00:10:38.258 --> 00:10:40.177
You already know what markets do best.

00:10:40.219 --> 00:10:42.429
They let people try stuff,

00:10:42.471 --> 00:10:45.391
they send strong signals
when that stuff isn't working,

00:10:45.391 --> 00:10:49.853
and they have fueled
an incredible arc of growth

00:10:49.895 --> 00:10:51.897
and poverty eradication.

00:10:53.273 --> 00:10:57.611
If we are to have optimism
for a radically better world

00:10:57.653 --> 00:11:01.532
to continue this path
that capitalism has put us on,